Malcolm Operator

This project deploys Malcolm (https://github.com/idaholab/Malcolm) and is
derived from the Malcolm Helm chart (https://github.com/idaholab/Malcolm-Helm).
The files under internal/render/assets/ (Strelka configuration, wise.ini,
nginx LDAP and Keycloak configuration samples) and the default configuration
values in internal/render/defaults.go are taken from those projects.

